<title>USA: Great Lakes Chem elects Evan Bayh to board.</title>
<headline>Great Lakes Chem elects Evan Bayh to board.</headline>
<dateline>WEST LAFAYETTE, Ind. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Lakes Chemical Corp said Monday it elected former Indiana Governor Evan Bayh to its board of directors.</p>
<p>His election increased the board to nine members.</p>
<p>Bayh held two terms as the state's governor. He was elected in 1988 and re-elected in 1992.</p>
<p>Great Lakes Chemical produces specialty chemicals for such applications as flame retardants, polymer stabilizers, fire extinguishers and water treatment.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
